unwolf is a Rust port of UberWolf / UberWolfLib / UberWolfCli
  Copyright (c) 2023 Sinflower, MIT License
  https://github.com/Sinflower/UberWolf (studied at commit f419137)

The Wolf RPG crypto layers (WolfCrypt), Pro key derivation (WolfPro), WolfX
decryption and the Wolf RPG file structures are ported from UberWolfLib.

The DX Library archive format (DXA v5, v6, v8: header layout, key derivation,
LZ and Huffman compression) is reimplemented from a written description of the
format, not translated from the DXArchive sources bundled with UberWolf.
The format and its original implementation are the work of Takumi Yamada:
